                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Another victim of 30fps cap console era epidemic where you need to put up with screen tearing for the game to not look laggy as fuck and yes i am using a 60hz monitor, im more of a car race kind of guy but the bikes seem extremely understeery and take every deep corner verry shallow, even when im slamming both sticks in the same direction, it seems you must use the brake to help finish a corner and be extremely patient.\n\nGoing in a straight line and scrubbing feels great but theres too many corners for me to have any fun, maybe this is just realistic to how motorbikes work in the real world but im definately not a fan of falling off my bike or turning excruciatingly slowly every time i go to turn, I think il leave this as a relic of the past and you should too.",
